  "reading": {
    "_note": "**不是从 projects.json 派生的变体** —— `reading` 是 P12 新增的第 6 类 block（长文阅读稿，`DEVIATIONS.md` F7 / `docs/copy-proposal.md` §12），原站没有它。形状只有一种：`paragraphs[]` 是段落数组，**没有标题**（方案没给阅读稿标题，不替站主发明文案）。上面的 `pause`（P10 M3 的第 5 类）当时漏了没补，一并记在此处。",
    "default": {
      "type": "reading",
      "index": 0,
      "background": null,
      "paddingBottom": true,
      "paragraphs": [
        "A long-form reading of the work. Paragraphs are plain strings; the template renders one <p> per entry.",
        "The module has no heading by design, and its measure is capped at 38em by .block-reading in style-new.css."
      ]
    }
